<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Determine a Solution to Inequalities</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00663</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Determine a Solution to Inequalities</md:title>
    <md:uuid>85e3a329-b19c-445a-ab8f-297a44f1add2</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Is the ordered pair \((5.43, 0)\) a solution to all, some, or none of these inequalities? Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</para>
<list>
    <item>\(x &gt; 0\)</item>
    <item>\(y &gt; 0\)</item>
    <item>\(x\;\geq\;0\)</item>
    <item>\(y\;\geq\;0\)</item>
</list></section>
</content>
</document>
